  },
  "91208-accept": {
   "build": "70291",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Aramis Hammerhand",
   "npc": "244808",
   "questID": 91208,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Not all of our fellow Paladins who rise again are quick to acclimate to our new reality. Some struggle to reconcile that they are now, in a way, the very thing they spent their lives fighting against.\r\n\r\nThese individuals often simply need a kind gesture and a sympathetic ear. Unfortunately, many others are quick to turn violent. Find the frightened $c who fled into the hills directly west of this chapel. Extend a hand in friendship. Lead them back into the light if you can.",
   "time": 1791509968,
   "title": "Coming to Terms",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "91209-accept": {
   "build": "70291",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "accept",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Aramis Hammerhand",
   "npc": "244808",
   "questID": 91209,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Lordaeron may not be what it used to be, but our home still needs protection from all manner of threats and it's time for you to go out and face the world. Your next stop should be the town of Brill in central Tirisfal Glades. Go and meet with Shari Stilwell there. She can see to your continued training. \r\n\r\nOne last bit of advice before you go--take extra care as a $c traveling through Forsaken lands. There are many in the Dark Lady's service who distrust us and our proximity to the light.",
   "time": 1791509972,
   "title": "Continue Your Training",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
  "91209-complete": {
   "build": "70291",
   "class": "Paladin",
   "differs": null,
   "event": "complete",
   "isObject": null,
   "mapID": 1420,
   "name": "Shari Stilwell",
   "npc": "246152",
   "questID": 91209,
   "race": "Undead",
   "sex": "m",
   "source": "community",
   "text": "Welcome aboard, $c. It's always encouraging to see more of our number roaming these lands. There are many here in Brill in need of assistance from adventurers such as yourself. Seek employment and grow stronger in the light. Return to me whenever you need training. \r\n\r\nWhen you've proven yourself to myself and the people of Brill, I will provide guidance for the next leg of your journey.\r\n\r\nGo with the light, $c.",
   "time": 1791518222,
   "title": "Continue Your Training",
   "wanted": true,
   "zone": "Tirisfal Glades"
  },
